# === Secrets & credentials — NEVER commit ===
*.env
.env*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
id_rsa*
*_token*
*secret*
*password*
*credential*
accounts.json
cookies.txt
*.har          # HTTP archives frequently contain live session cookies

# === Raw evidence that may hold PII / session data ===
evidence/raw/
**/_private/
**/_quarantine/

# === OS / editor noise ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/

# === PRIVATE ENGAGEMENT — never publish (NDA) ===
targets/credify/
targets/upgrade/
targets/neon/

